{"updated":"2026-11-08T01:56:03.291Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"DfcSA5DE5Js","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfcSA5DE5Js","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"做 2D 遊戲最崩潰的，不是寫程式，而是角色動畫要一幀一幀畫\n\n只要提供角色描述，就能透過 AI Agent 產生遊戲用的角色素材與動畫。\n\n🎨 AI 生成角色，維持不同動作的外觀一致性\n🏃 自動製作待機、走路、跑步、攻擊等動畫\n🪄 將影片轉成透明背景的 Sprite Sheet、PNG、GIF\n🗺️ 支援生成 2D 地圖與像素風格素材\n🎮 可匯出 Godot、Aseprite 與網頁遊戲素材\n🤖 支援 Claude Code、Codex、Grok\n\n#AI #GameDev #PixelArt #OpenSource #ClaudeCode","timestamp":"2026-11-07T13:24:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":2,"reposts":1,"shares":3},"score":10,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfcSA6AE83B","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfcSA6AE83B","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/0x0fu…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-07T13:24:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfYj5X-k7zX","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfYj5X-k7zX","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"持股已經綠到有牛在上面吃草了","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:43:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfYj5VgEyWr","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfYj5VgEyWr","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"malilion.github.io/cow-p…","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:43:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfXdrGXk3EH","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfXdrGXk3EH","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/elvar…","timestamp":"2026-11-05T16:29:44.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfXHwAzk-WV","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfXHwAzk-WV","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"做像素風遊戲，最花時間的可能不是寫程式，而是製作各種動畫特效！\n\n🔥 火焰、爆炸、閃電、冰霜與魔法\n⚔️ 攻擊、技能、受擊與角色動作\n🌧️ 天氣、粒子、UI 與場景轉場\n🎨 支援自訂顏色、即時預覽與 Sprite Sheet 匯出\n\n最酷的是還提供 Claude Code Skill，可以直接叫 AI 幫你設計新特效、調整動畫，甚至輸出成 Godot、Unity 能使用的素材\n\n不用從零開始畫每一幀，對獨立遊戲開發者來說真的超方便！\n\n而且採用 MIT 授權，商業遊戲也能使用\n#OpenSource #GitHub #GameDev #PixelArt #ClaudeCode","timestamp":"2026-11-05T13:18:10.000Z","stats":{"likes":11,"replies":1,"reposts":3,"shares":4},"score":22,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfXHvwMk-zt","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfXHvwMk-zt","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/patch…\n「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-05T13:18:08.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DfcWNL2jjZt","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfcWNL2jjZt","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"你身邊也有「討伐型人格」的朋友嗎？👀\n\n□ 被問不想回答的私事，直接說「這個不方便說」\n□ 不想繼續尬聊，能說「我先走了」就離開 \n□ 看朋友被纏住，會主動上前幫忙解圍\n□ 遇到擾人的行為，敢當面提出來\n□ 平常客氣好相處，被踩到底線也會明確拒絕\n□ 絕不內耗，直接外耗\n\n標註你勇猛的「討伐型人格」朋友\n謝謝他們成為你的嘴替👄","timestamp":"2026-11-07T14:00:41.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":1,"reposts":1,"shares":0},"score":11,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfcWOAEDr2v","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfcWOAEDr2v","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"我現在就要原地爆炸！！！\n原文來自👄很羨慕我哥是討伐型人格的人👄\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多相關的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-07T14:00:48.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfcPQwykXuN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfcPQwykXuN","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"金牛看起來沒意見，心裡其實默默在打分數？\n♉ 卡友分享的金牛感情觀，你認同哪些👇\n\n□ 投入感情前會顧慮很多，不輕易開始\n□ 約會會觀察穿著、談吐，細節都記在心裡\n□ 比起硬裝厲害，更能接受坦承自己的短處\n□ 看似突然冷掉，其實不滿已經累積很久\n□ 不是對誰都念舊，特別的人才容易放不下\n\n你們覺得準，還是想出來平反？👀","timestamp":"2026-11-07T13:00:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfcPRklEVKV","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfcPRklEVKV","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨金牛座的感情觀 （黑暗版）✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多星座的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-07T13:00:07.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfcIa4uDfTn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfcIa4uDfTn","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"雙魚表面很被動，心裡其實暈的迷迷冒冒？\n♓ 雙魚卡友來自我檢核👇\n\n□ 喜歡也不敢太主動，連留言都想很久\n□ 很吃貼心小驚喜，手寫卡片也能心動\n□ 愛跟另一半想像未來，連住哪都想好了\n□ 容易想太多，遠距離更需要明確的未來\n□ 不太會拒絕別人，卻常被誤會有意思\n\n哪一項根本就是你？👀","timestamp":"2026-11-07T12:00:13.000Z","stats":{"likes":18,"replies":1,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":23,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfcIcBGDRVo","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfcIcBGDRVo","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨雙魚女作戰手則✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多星座的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-07T12:00:23.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfcBm7zk1YA","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfcBm7zk1YA","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"為了台股，我做什麼都甘願。\n嚴肅參考卡友的省錢妙招\n\n□ 能自己煮就少外食，飲料改成自己泡\n□ 檢查手機用量，不一定要辦吃到飽\n□ 搭大眾運輸、騎腳踏車，非必要不養車\n□ 買東西先比價，網購不一定比實體便宜\n□ 想買的小廢物先放購物車，過陣子再決定","timestamp":"2026-11-07T11:00:42.000Z","stats":{"likes":14,"replies":4,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":22,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T09:56:56+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfcBn62E85S","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfcBn62E85S","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"我選擇睡大安森林公園","timestamp":"2026-11-07T11:00:50.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T09:56:56+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfcBpEmk0SN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfcBpEmk0SN","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"千萬不要買 i 珍食","timestamp":"2026-11-07T11:01:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T09:56:56+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfb6tE1jw9K","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfb6tE1jw9K","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"各位⋯⋯的⋯⋯0050⋯⋯還好⋯⋯嗎？\n\n卡友說他昨天中午入手兩張0050\n收盤小賺還沒入袋\n但今天綠油油\n不知道各位的0050還好嗎？要抱多久？","timestamp":"2026-11-07T10:00:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":19,"replies":12,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":43,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T09:56:56+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfb6uTmjzr7","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfb6uTmjzr7","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B2：入手在109 105 平均在106的我🫠","timestamp":"2026-11-07T10:00:32.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T09:56:56+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfb6wU9j6xJ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfb6wU9j6xJ","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B18：下跌是給你加碼的","timestamp":"2026-11-07T10:00:49.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T09:56:56+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZxYqCj-Sa","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfZxYqCj-Sa","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"好奇大家遇過的約會地雷\n原po先分享！\n\n1.去看電影的時候，全程都用正常音量講話而不是低聲討論：）\n2.去餐廳的時候直接坐裡面，比較舒服的沙發椅，不到雷但就覺得蠻不貼心的","timestamp":"2026-11-06T14:00:28.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T09:56:56+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZxaEaj_Jc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfZxaEaj_Jc","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"大家有遇到什麼小地雷呢🧐\n原文來自✨好奇大家遇過的約會地雷✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多感情相關討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-06T14:00:39.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T09:56:56+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZjnIaDeMA","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfZjnIaDeMA","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"有錢的台北人都吃什麼？\n\n原po是大學生，桃園人在台中唸書\n有個好朋友是台北人\n平常一起出去玩的時候她並不會特別表現的非常有錢\n但跟她聊天有時候會透露出一些優越感\n\n昨天晚上在討論美食\n討論到某家很有名高級自助餐廳\n她說她回台北的時候常常吃，我跟她說我沒吃過\n她用有點驚訝的表情看我\n接著又說，她家也常常吃鼎*豐，我說我也沒吃過\n\n她完全藏不住，用一個傻眼的臉看著我\n然後問我「那妳們家晚餐都吃什麼？」\n我回答「我媽會煮啊⋯⋯」","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:00:06.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":11,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T09:56:56+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZjoXLjdSl","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfZjoXLjdSl","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"有沒有台北市人回答原po\n你們家晚餐常常都吃這麼貴的外食嗎？><","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:00:16.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T09:56:56+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZcyFnDCh7","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfZcyFnDCh7","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"有沒有人可以幫忙判斷一下\n這樣是有意思還是沒意思🥺\n\n1.認識一個月，每天都會傳訊息\n2.約出去過，沒有肢體接觸\n3.他會主動跟你說他下班，分享三餐給妳看\n4.但有時候你回覆他\n他可能隔天才回你\n早安","timestamp":"2026-11-06T11:00:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":51,"replies":4,"reposts":0,"shares":5},"score":59,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T09:56:56+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"DfdejQbk3CK","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfdejQbk3CK","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"副駕座椅下不只收雜物，還能藏泡腳盆？深藍汽車的一項專利構想，用折疊盆體搭配伸縮機構，需要時再拉出展開。收納、排水與車內防潮怎麼兼顧，是設計重點；專利公開不代表已量產，尚未公布搭載車型與實裝時間。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-08T00:32:51.000Z","stats":{"like