archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-07T06:36:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfbjSC1Ejur","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfbjSC1Ejur","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Meta 想讓你用聊天打造自己的小工具！Muse 新增 Spaces，把想法變成互動空間，還能用自然語言修改功能與介面。官方示範遊戲、活動追蹤器與家庭控制面板，和一般獨立 App 有什麼不同？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-07T06:35:42.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"Dfb1JjoHznL","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Dfb1JjoHznL","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"There is a Grok Bot in the Line group, which is really very convenient.\n\nThe Bot can do: \n - Ask everyone about the convenient dining time \n - Find restaurants for everyone to choose from \n - After choosing a restaurant, directly open the inline or Open Table website to book a reservation \n - After the reservation is made, it can also create a calendar \n - Send the calendar link back to the group\n\nPreviously, there had to be a person as the group leader \n Now, just directly send the group leader to the AI to act as it.","timestamp":"2026-11-07T09:11:50.000Z","stats":{"likes":182,"replies":23,"reposts":14,"shares":114},"score":270,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZZlZDn0RU","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfZZlZDn0RU","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Accompanying customers in their dreams (O)  \nAccompanying customers in their automation (X)\n\nRecently, I suddenly felt a sudden improvement in AI model progress.  \nFive months ago, the same customer request  \nUsing the then-opus system could only achieve a 6x% success rate.\n\nNow, with only Sonnet 5.5,  \nit can achieve over 99% success rate.\n\nThis scenario is a major pain point for customer processes.  \nThey would receive a PDF with a huge number of pages,  \nwhich previously required manual page-by-page processing and typing.\n\nNow, because they have introduced a new ERP system,  \nthe system itself can easily connect to AI,  \nand they have also benefited from the improvement in AI models.\n\nThey only need to do one thing in the system: upload  \nThen, just let the AI + system handle the rest.  \nA PDF → over a hundred pages of data → automatically appears in the system.  \nThe staff only need to confirm the items with lower AI confidence.\n\nAn hour of work is now less than a minute!  \nIf you want to know which ERP system this is ↓","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:32:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":20,"replies":2,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":27,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZZl3NHyAF","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfZZl3NHyAF","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Welcome to inquire about Odoo ERP \n Find @lupus_rr for an assessment of whether your company is suitable for switching to Odoo\n\nEnjoy a simple and easy-to-use ERP system that can be customized according to your needs","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:32:33.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfWiscZn__A","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfWiscZn__A","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"ChatGPT Images 2.6 is quite interesting. \nIt can produce very accurate SVGs, and the GIF effect is also quite good. \nHowever, making GIFs should be quite expensive.","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:54:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":21,"replies":4,"reposts":2,"shares":4},"score":35,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv